WEBVTT

00:00:01.890 --> 00:00:12.820
Pain... Despair... Pain... Despair...

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:16.030
Repeat above...

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:21.910
Herc, oh Herc.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:25.290
There seems to be a water vein here.

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:29.170
Pain. Despair.

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:30.500
Pain―

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:31.760
The water is out!

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:34.010
Everyone, we can irrigate our crops now!

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:35.260
Yay!

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:38.180
We got our Toys back, too.

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:41.140
What's more, we can do our jobs now.

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:43.350
And...

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:46.480
If Henriette-san comes back...

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:48.520
We can revive our school!

00:00:55.070 --> 00:00:58.990
Arséne! How dare you come back to Yokohama!

00:00:58.990 --> 00:01:00.030
I'm arresting you!

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:04.910
Yes! I caught you!

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:11.590
Where are you looking at?

00:01:11.590 --> 00:01:13.300
Hold it right there!

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:16.220
My bombs, blow everyone up!

00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:20.010
Hirano's Lacrosse Spin!

00:01:21.970 --> 00:01:23.970
I'll fight you to the death!

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:26.770
Do whatever you want. I'm giving it my all today!

00:01:26.770 --> 00:01:29.810
Stupid. Like I would care!

00:01:29.810 --> 00:01:32.730
Battling with the Phantom Thief Empire who just returned right now.

00:01:34.610 --> 00:01:35.740
What a nice scent.

00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:37.500
Come down from that place!

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:39.780
The Yokohama Perfume.

00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:44.200
Tonight I will lay in bed in my nightgown, wearing this perfume.

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:47.830
What? Are you hit?

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:48.790
I let my guard down.

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:49.460
What?

00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:54.550
Excuse me, everyone in G4.

00:01:54.550 --> 00:01:55.880
Hold it right there!

00:01:55.880 --> 00:01:58.930
Do you think you can escape from me!?

00:01:58.930 --> 00:02:02.300
Don't you underestimate my IQ of 14*10^20!

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:05.810
Even though they got their Toys back, why are they not trying to stop us?

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:09.270
What is Milky Holmes doing?

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:13.940
Neo Holmes Detective Academy!

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:15.440
We're accepting students!

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:17.280
We also have a farm!

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:20.610
We, the renowned detectives, will be teaching you.

00:02:20.610 --> 00:02:22.490
You need to pay school fees, though.

00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:24.910
Well, they did save the world.

00:02:24.910 --> 00:02:29.580
But the ones who unsealed Pandora's jar...

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:31.000
...was Milky Holmes.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:32.460
What a charade.

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:35.000
We also have crop harvests.

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:35.800
Breaking news.

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:41.970
Phantom Thief Empire has made a comeback at the Detective World Fair in Yokohama.

00:02:41.970 --> 00:02:43.220
Arsène is back!?

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:44.140
Twenty!

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:45.100
Stone River!

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:46.140
Lighting Sir!

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:46.810
I'm Ra―

00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:53.190
Well... In response to their appearance, Yokohama's G4 has been dispatched,

00:02:53.190 --> 00:02:55.730
but they allowed the treasure to be stolen.

00:02:55.730 --> 00:02:57.740
What are the G4 bastards doing!?

00:02:58.190 --> 00:03:02.030
We could've arrested Arsène and her people if we knew that...!

00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:03.910
You should've sensed them, Cordelia!

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:06.040
I was concentrating on water veins...

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:09.660
And we're using the radio for field work now...

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:10.960
I want to fight them!

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:13.330
I want to fight Arsène!

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:16.090
I won't forgive Arsène and their company for breaking the peace in Yokohama!

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:20.130
Stop ruining our peaceful life in Yokohama!

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:21.680
I'm from a property insurance company!

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:25.890
They used the radio for field work?

00:03:26.510 --> 00:03:28.220
I guess it can't be helped.

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:30.980
I've got to send a challenge letter to them today.

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:35.560
But unleashing such destructive power just from being a bit excited...

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:37.860
I'm looking forward to a battle with you.

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:43.280
But it'd have been better if Henriette-san came back instead of Arsène.

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:44.870
You're right.

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:48.950
I'm sure she will come back if we continue to work hard.

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:50.290
Yeah, she will.

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:51.870
My sweets!

00:03:51.870 --> 00:03:53.000
My Prez!

00:03:54.330 --> 00:03:55.290
Yes, she will!

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:02.760
Oh my, Sherlock. It's been a long t―

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:04.260
Have a flier!

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:08.100
We gave out all the fliers!

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:09.970
A lot of students will come and apply!

00:04:09.970 --> 00:04:11.430
I can't wait.

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:16.060
There is a nice fragrance in the air, isn't there?

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:18.320
Yuzurizaki-san, what a coinciden―

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:20.480
An Umaumabo stand!

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:23.450
Umaumabo, fresh and hot!

00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:26.120
Food! Food! Food!

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:41.170
I feel so good! Sailor Uniform!

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:42.170
I don't know.

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:44.090
Rather, I don't care about the reason!

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:48.760
Henriette-san!

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:50.680
Oh, what a coincidence.

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:52.520
Where did you go!?

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:54.520
We were worried about you.

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:58.810
I had to do a few things to rebuild the school.

00:04:58.810 --> 00:05:00.230
Then you mean...

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:02.740
...you will be...

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:05.610
...our Prez again?

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:09.580
Since you said it, I guess I'll take my role again.

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:12.040
Yay! We love you!

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:16.000
Umaumabo is so tasty.

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:18.250
We ate so much that the hawker scolded us.

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:21.800
My hat.

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:23.340
Thank you, Cordelia.

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:27.630
Long time no see, Milky Holmes.

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:29.800
Coron-chan!

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:32.060
You all look well!

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:34.100
You've been having lots of adventures lately, huh?

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:36.770
Oh, my carelessness again.

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:39.860
I'm not afraid to wear these pants in summer!

00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:42.900
By the way, did you girls enter the contest?

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:44.360
Enter?

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:48.110
Mascot Girl Contest exclusive to the Detective World Fair.

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:51.780
I came here to enter the contest.

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:55.120
If I were to be chosen, my reputation as a detective will soar to great heights and besides,

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:58.040
it'd be great advertising for Dad's fried skewer store!

00:05:58.040 --> 00:06:00.540
I can kill two birds with one stone!

00:06:05.630 --> 00:06:09.550
Perseverance prevails!

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:13.890
But if I remember correctly, the participant requirements prohibit those without Toys...

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:16.060
We can enter now.

00:06:16.060 --> 00:06:18.310
That's right! We got our Toys back!

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:20.690
We'll be chosen!

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:23.860
If Henriette-san sees us on the contest, she will come back!

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:26.740
Mascot Girl Contest! Go for it!

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:28.900
Don't get too cheeky!

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:30.990
I'll be chosen!

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:33.030
We will!

00:06:33.030 --> 00:06:33.870
Fried skewers!

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:36.950
Fried sticks! Cheers!

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:41.130
See you tomorrow.

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:45.300
Oh, but you're still not allowed to double-dip.

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:47.630
Coron-sama, cabbages please!

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:48.340
Cabbages?

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:50.880
You can have more.

00:06:51.800 --> 00:06:53.800
Mascot Girl Contest.

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:57.220
Let's go back quickly and prepare ourselves.

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:08.650
This is the contest venue.

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:11.990
It's written on the signboard.

00:07:11.990 --> 00:07:13.620
I have to do my best.

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:16.370
Even if the others are knocked out in the first round,

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:22.210
I, the most beautiful girl of the group, will take the first prize and show it to Prez!

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:24.920
I'm the best within Milky Holmes.

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:33.470
This is the place where I, the white maiden of Milky Holmes, will be of help.

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:36.140
Let's do our best!

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:40.100
Kokoro-chan, you're participating too!?

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:43.190
Didn't you know?

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:48.440
There were too few participants, so I had some backup.

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:49.490
The police...

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:52.030
I'll win it because I want to!

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:55.450
I'm Akechi Kokoro, genius IQ of 140 gazillion!

00:07:55.450 --> 00:08:00.410
Kokoro-chan, I heard that the Phantom Thief Empire stole the treasure.

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:03.620
Cheer up. This always happe―

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:05.580
Shut you, you bitch!

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:06.880
Can the old lady be in it?

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:07.880
Drill!

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:09.050
Gamera! Kigasa!

00:08:09.460 --> 00:08:11.090
High school girl, Wanko.

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:13.720
Daddy is the happiest person ever!

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:16.970
Pops, thank you for taking care of me.

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:18.640
This isn't a marriage!

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:22.100
No matter who will enter, we won't lose!

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:23.440
We will win the first prize!

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:24.100
Yes!

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:25.060
Ow!

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:28.320
There was a fish cake in my shoes!

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:31.110
How cruel! Who would do such a thing?

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:32.690
We didn't notice.

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:35.950
That shows the battle has just started.

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:37.120
You're right.

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:38.910
Don't resent one another.

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:41.160
Okay, I'll do my best.

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:41.870
Who are you?

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:45.170
Milky Holmes, go for it!

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:53.630
Their skins are so glossy.

00:08:53.630 --> 00:08:55.720
Oba-san, do your best!

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:02.270
Detective World Fair, Mascot Girl Contest.

00:09:02.270 --> 00:09:06.020
I'll be your host, Terry!

00:09:06.020 --> 00:09:07.520
This is what everyone is waiting for!

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:11.110
Do your best!

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:32.920
Man...

00:09:33.630 --> 00:09:37.720
The Detective World Fair Mascot Girl Contest didn't turn out well for me.

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:40.350
Just a little more and I would have...

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:42.930
Cabbage, and more servings if you want.

00:09:42.930 --> 00:09:46.230
My god didn't help me at all.

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:51.320
Also, send my regards to Milky Holmes.

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:54.690
Oh, and you won't get second servings.

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:57.820
Listen up! I didn't win!

00:09:57.820 --> 00:10:02.990
How could I lose!? My IQ's 1400 mega-gazillion! I'm Akechi Kokoro, and I'm drop-dead gorgeous!

00:10:04.240 --> 00:10:06.370
Detective World Fair!

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:10.080
I was going to change it to "G4 World Fair" or "Kokoro World Fair"!

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:14.130
This is precisely the reason you weren't chosen.

00:10:14.130 --> 00:10:17.010
Yeah. This is precisely the reason you weren't chosen.

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:19.590
This is precisely the reason you weren't chosen.

00:10:19.590 --> 00:10:21.430
Don't you say that!

00:10:21.430 --> 00:10:23.430
This is precisely the reason you weren't chosen.

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:24.430
Shut up!

00:10:24.430 --> 00:10:27.560
Don't call me Kokoro-chan!

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:30.060
Umm...

00:10:30.520 --> 00:10:34.270
I was really embarrassed in front of the crowd.

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:37.320
No! Don't put the camera so close to me!

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:40.700
You've started recording?

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:43.330
Really, I just can't accept this.

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:45.540
The kanji for telephone and table.

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:47.540
And I totally sucked at speaking politely.

00:10:47.540 --> 00:10:49.370
I didn't learn to do that at all.

00:10:49.370 --> 00:10:52.330
It's so unfair that only Sher made it through!

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:53.960
She speaks politely all the time, that's why!

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:58.130
Please buy my flowers~

00:10:58.130 --> 00:11:01.800
I wanted to be the Mascot Girl~

00:11:01.800 --> 00:11:05.970
But the night before I had a terrible―

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:10.390
Thank you for waiting!

00:11:10.390 --> 00:11:12.810
We now have two participants for the finals!

00:11:12.810 --> 00:11:16.980
The best of the best will fight to the end!

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:25.740
Everyone knows she will win - the masked girl, Mysterious Jermaine!

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:28.120
Of course she will!

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:35.130
She advanced with a tiny ray of hope and pure luck - Sherlock Shellingford!

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:42.970
Is it finally time for the reasoning debate!?

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:44.140
Reasoning debate.

00:11:44.140 --> 00:11:46.050
Well, this is the Detective World Fair after all.

00:11:46.050 --> 00:11:47.510
Dance!

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:01.570
Dance?

00:12:01.570 --> 00:12:03.490
How's that even related to detectives!?

00:12:03.490 --> 00:12:05.410
Don't kid me! Ars―

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:06.820
Go to hell, giant-head!

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:08.830
W-What should I do?

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:10.870
I haven't danced before!

00:12:10.870 --> 00:12:13.580
Just dance like a mad man!

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:15.670
I don't understand at all.

00:12:15.670 --> 00:12:18.460
I know Henriette-sama will win.

00:12:18.460 --> 00:12:20.420
But why do they need to have a new genre?

00:12:20.420 --> 00:12:21.720
I don't get it at all.

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:23.550
I don't understand you the most.

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:24.510
Sher!

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:27.550
Go for it!

00:12:27.550 --> 00:12:30.470
For our academy and for our Prez!

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:33.890
I'll cheer you on because it's for the Prez!

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:38.650
I'll become a great detective for the Prez!

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:43.490
For the academy... And for Henriette-san to come back!

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:46.490
Are you looking at me, Henriette-san!?

00:12:54.460 --> 00:12:55.370
Please take care of me.

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:57.330
Sure!

00:12:57.330 --> 00:12:59.800
This hand...

00:13:00.380 --> 00:13:02.760
Do you really want to trump me?

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:04.220
Yes!

00:13:08.390 --> 00:13:09.930
Will she be fine!?

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:10.930
Sher!

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:11.720
Go on!

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:13.310
I'm sorry.

00:13:13.310 --> 00:13:15.140
This is my first time dancing.

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:17.480
Draw out the strength from your body.

00:13:18.730 --> 00:13:20.690
Follow my lead.

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:21.730
But...

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:22.820
You can do it.

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:43.800
I wonder why...

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:46.800
My body moves on its own.

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:51.180
As if it's being guided by this person.

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:54.890
This person is amazing.

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:58.400
Who is this person?

00:13:58.400 --> 00:13:59.560
Who is she?

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:00.610
Big and bouncy!

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:02.730
Jermaine, the epitome of art!

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:05.400
I'll lose if this keeps up.

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:07.700
Henriette-san won't come back.

00:14:08.410 --> 00:14:11.370
I'll do my best and win the first prize!

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:13.620
Problem solved!

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:15.080
Oh no...

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:17.710
The dance is a complete explosion!

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:18.790
Ten points!

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:20.330
Yay!

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:25.160
I won't lose!

00:14:25.160 --> 00:14:33.970
I'm always searching, I'm always hungering.

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:37.180
I want to see you soon.

00:14:37.180 --> 00:14:49.780
It's a bit tiring, but we'll be back to where we were, just like a pendulum.

00:14:49.780 --> 00:15:01.830
I'm chasing you, I turn my back and run with all my might.

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:14.010
I cried at the goal. The solution is that the culprit...

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:20.270
...is you, right?

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:33.160
I'm going to lead you, I'm going to be lead by you until we are beyond the stars.

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:39.910
You're the culprit, right?

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:47.170
The result is out!

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:51.680
The winner for the Mascot Girl Contest is...

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:53.130
...Jermaine!

00:15:53.130 --> 00:15:54.680
Big and bouncy!

00:15:55.890 --> 00:15:57.430
Sher lost but...

00:15:57.430 --> 00:15:58.310
...brilliant.

00:15:58.310 --> 00:15:59.980
This was the expected result. Boring.

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:01.520
Goodness!

00:16:01.520 --> 00:16:03.230
Jermaine, you did well!

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:04.560
I'm so glad!

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:06.480
Big and bouncy!

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:09.570
I lost.

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:13.150
Henriette-san, I'm sorry.

00:16:13.150 --> 00:16:14.860
Winner, any comments?

00:16:15.490 --> 00:16:17.660
I'm honored to have won this contest.

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:20.660
It was time well spent while returning to Yokohama.

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:23.870
S-She looks...

00:16:23.870 --> 00:16:24.790
...familiar.

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:36.510
What? Jermaine is...

00:16:36.510 --> 00:16:37.600
What the hell!?

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:40.560
...Henriette Mystère!

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:42.310
Henriette-san!

00:16:42.310 --> 00:16:43.690
You came back!

00:16:43.690 --> 00:16:45.690
Prez!

00:16:47.110 --> 00:16:48.940
What do you call yourselves?

00:16:50.900 --> 00:16:54.030
Milky Holmes! We're detectives!

00:16:55.740 --> 00:16:58.740
You've finally become great detectives.

00:16:59.700 --> 00:17:00.620
I'm back.

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:03.460
You're the detective of the detectives!

00:17:03.460 --> 00:17:05.960
You're our only Prez!

00:17:05.960 --> 00:17:08.170
Prez, we love you!

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:18.090
It's dark! It's scary!

00:17:18.090 --> 00:17:20.970
It's so dark! Save me!

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:23.980
I can't. It's too heavy.

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:26.480
I can't move it.

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:28.100
Come out, my powers!

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:31.610
We lost our Toys!

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:33.780
This is a lie! Why must this happen?

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:34.650
No!

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:37.990
I want to be a great detective!

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:44.910
That cloud looks like a fish cake!

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:51.380
Our Toys disappeared again.

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:53.630
Why did they disappear?

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:56.970
For once I thought we had become great detectives.

00:17:56.970 --> 00:17:58.930
What are you doing?

00:17:58.930 --> 00:17:59.840
Come here now!

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:02.430
The seniors of Milky Holmes are the same too!

00:18:03.890 --> 00:18:07.770
Always, they lose their path, scampering out behind others...

00:18:08.390 --> 00:18:11.480
But they will never forget the will to move on!

00:18:12.480 --> 00:18:17.280
The one who will pull them back to the path can only be the School Council―

00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:19.240
Sherlock Shellingford-san.

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:20.410
Here!

00:18:21.530 --> 00:18:23.080
Cordelia Glacua-san.

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:24.200
H-Here!

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:25.910
Yuzurizaki Nero-san.

00:18:25.910 --> 00:18:26.700
Here!

00:18:26.700 --> 00:18:28.330
Hercule Barton-san.

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:29.870
H-Here.

00:18:29.870 --> 00:18:31.540
I shall start the lesson.

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:34.210
We'll start from the beginning...

00:18:34.210 --> 00:18:36.550
...no, right from zero.

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:40.760
Because one day, you will arrest Arsène.

00:18:40.760 --> 00:18:41.760
Yes!

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:46.430
Here are your printouts.

00:18:46.430 --> 00:18:47.430
Nezu-kun.

00:18:47.430 --> 00:18:49.520
Why did you come here?

00:18:50.230 --> 00:18:52.360
I took the trouble to come back!

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:56.480
The Prez will be troubled by only having the useless and Toys-less Milky Holmes as students!

00:18:56.480 --> 00:18:58.860
Nijuuri-sensei, please.

00:18:58.860 --> 00:18:59.900
Yes!

00:18:59.900 --> 00:19:02.820
Okay, you useless students!

00:19:02.820 --> 00:19:05.740
I'll engrave the foundations all the way into your skull.

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:08.660
First, read the printouts!

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:10.420
Toys. They are...

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:11.750
Your voices are too soft!

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:16.130
...miraculous buds that swell from the hearts of the chosen.

00:19:16.500 --> 00:19:22.140
Some flowers are born pure, while others bloom laced with poison.

00:19:22.720 --> 00:19:24.390
The Age of Detectives.

00:19:24.760 --> 00:19:27.970
The two flowers, vying for beauty.

00:19:27.970 --> 00:19:31.850
Their names are the Detective and the Phantom Thief.

00:19:41.910 --> 00:19:44.240
All right!
